# Astra's explicit C/POSIX ABI additions. Most are Astra definitions absent
# from Picolibc; compiler runtimes may also require a Picolibc implementation
# that is not part of the standard-header API audit. One C identifier per line;
# the generated version map is the installed ABI and forces archive selection.

